{"id":"vod_bf_17198","vodId":"17198","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"机巧少女不会受伤","name_cn":"机巧少女不会受伤","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第12集","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-18/92486fd13603b0c5faf21e7ca2e585ec.jpg"},"summary":"电视动画《机巧少女不会受伤》改编自海冬零儿执笔，LLO插图的同名轻小说。故事围绕人偶师赤羽雷真和他的少女型人偶搭档夜夜展开。机巧魔术，那是人形使们用来操纵内藏着魔术回路的自动人形而用的魔术，拥有这种技术的最高学府是英国的沃普尔吉斯王立机巧学院，目前正举行着决定人形使之顶点“魔王”，通称为“夜会”的战斗。如今有两个人影正走过它的大门，来自日本的留学生赤羽雷真与他的伙伴的少女型人形的夜夜，为了得到“夜会”的参加资格，雷真决定直接用决斗的方式从参加预定者那里夺取资格。目标是次期魔王有力候补，外号是暴龙的美少女夏洛特，但是没想到在决斗途中竟然发生意想不到的插曲……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-04-02 19:30:34","playable":true,"episodeCount":28,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"SP01","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiqiaoshaonvbuhuishoushang/SP01/index.m3u8"},{"name":"SP02","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiqiaoshaonvbuhuishoushang/SP02/index.m3u8"},{"name":"SP03","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiqiaoshaonvbuhuishoushang/SP03/index.m3u8"},{"name":"SP04","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiqiaoshaonvbuhuishoushang/SP04/index.m3u8"},{"name":"SP05","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiqiaoshaonvbuhuishoushang/SP05/index.m3u8"},{"name":"SP06","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiqiaoshaonvbuhuishoushang/SP06/index.m3u8"},{"name":"SP07","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiqiaoshaonvbuhuishoushang/SP07/index.m3u8"},{"name":"SP08","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiqiaoshaonvbuhuishoushang/SP08/index.m3u8"},{"name":"SP09","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiqiaoshaonvbuhuishoushang/SP09/index.m3u8"},{"name":"SP10","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiqiaoshaonvbuhuishoushang/SP10/index.m3u8"},{"name":"SP11","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiqiaoshaonvbuhuishoushang/SP11/index.m3u8"},{"name":"SP12","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiqiaoshaonvbuhuishoushang/SP12/index.m3u8"},{"